  "name": "Decimation transforms the seventh Reap and cleans up the replacement (#2257)",
  "contract": [
    "Decimation promises that every sixth Reap enables Decimate for the next Reap within 15 seconds. Six",
    "normal Reaps must land before a replacement is granted, the seventh original Reap request must",
    "resolve as Decimate, and consuming, expiring or removing the talent must restore Reap. The",
    "expiry/removal checks use a six-stack fixture after the real acquisition path has been proven.",
    "Decimate explicitly requires a two-handed melee weapon in its equipment masks, so the fixture learns",
    "two-handed swords and equips a Battleworn Claymore."
